ed phoenix. Confident, noisy, rude. He has feathers instead of ears and a scar on his lip.\n\nReferences: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11_4DdITtyciH5DzWj5zQzC7dGinWxedM\n\nThe two of them are star gods. They are rivals in a romantic relationship. The blue one takes care of the stars and the red one destroys them. I will leave the pose and composition up to you!\n\nPlease draw freely. If there are any problems, you can decline the request!\n\nThank you for considering..! 💞", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@S_k328/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7a0c2558/uploads/origins/500ffe47-e4e4-474e-b3cb-13710c9b4f89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=80f7c8c1557efc21f59c54d5935f1cc6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7a0c2558/uploads/origins/500ffe47-e4e4-474e-b3cb-13710c9b4f89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=80f7c8c1557efc21f59c54d5935f1cc6, https://si.imgix.net/7a0c2558/uploads/origins/500ffe47-e4e4-474e-b3cb-13710c9b4f89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=35042fef5ce7e9e975ed94f860162e9a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7a0c2558/uploads/origins/500ffe47-e4e4-474e-b3cb-13710c9b4f89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e35b78dbb901ea15b9a488238f35214a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@S_k328/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e99f6091/uploads/origins/ef781efb-2550-4cef-847b-36e75e1733fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=we